WEBVTT

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:26.030
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:26.790
<b>Chaika the Coffin Princess</b>

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:45.390
Dull ache...

00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:47.350
Scratches... Lucky.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:49.550
Fredrica?

00:01:50.210 --> 00:01:51.440
Fredrica!

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:56.300
Please answer! Fredrica!

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:02.010
Darn it! What's with this island?

00:02:08.540 --> 00:02:11.440
I wonder where Chaika landed.

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:23.120
You okay, Princess?

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.010
Yes.

00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:27.330
Looks like we made it to the 
island we were heading for.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:30.830
It appears that fog was produced 
by magic to conceal the island.

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:33.530
What's wrong?

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:34.220
Hurt?

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:37.770
Yeah, a fragment from the 
ship hit me. Just my luck.

00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:42.300
Let's get to land quick, 
before that monster comes back.

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:00.900
Worried about the saboteur boy?

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:02.640
N-No!

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:05.860
Well, no need. He's not the type to 
let something like that kill him.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:14.530
Magic does come in handy at times like this.

00:03:14.530 --> 00:03:18.420
I agree. If only you hadn't 
fought with Chaika,

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:20.550
we might be at the top by now.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:22.470
Are you trying to smart off?

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.780
I would never smart off 
to my beloved Brother.

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:30.140
Though, if being insulted is a fetish 
of yours, I would gladly...

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:31.640
Shut up and climb!

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:35.150
The Writhing Island

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:53.820
Orthros...

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:56.770
Els, nyme, ainkt, mu...

00:03:57.620 --> 00:03:59.420
Brilliant flash, appear!

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:01.330
The Flasher!

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:26.340
Intruders must be taken!

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:27.880
Come with us!

00:04:29.020 --> 00:04:30.960
Island... natives?

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:34.290
Want to know more about island!

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:36.600
Intruders must be taken!

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:37.670
Come with us!

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:45.460
It's fine that we got to the island, 
but what do we do now?

00:04:45.460 --> 00:04:47.970
Guy said we'd find out when we got here.

00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:53.430
Who?

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:58.140
This is...

00:04:58.140 --> 00:04:59.320
It's Chaika's.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:02.150
So she's definitely here.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:04.130
Brother.

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:04.650
Yeah.

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:11.950
Demi-human soldiers?

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:14.270
Are they this island's guards?

00:05:14.270 --> 00:05:15.260
Looks that way.

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:18.970
If these guys are roaming around, 
there must be something here.

00:05:18.970 --> 00:05:23.340
If Chaika is here, 
they may already have her.

00:05:24.520 --> 00:05:28.110
I'm following them. You search the forest.

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:28.930
Understood.

00:05:35.380 --> 00:05:36.770
Island underground...

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:38.800
Giant facility.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:42.690
Father's fortune... here.

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:52.860
Izhmash-sama.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:55.810
What are the Fayla doing?

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:59.150
They are operating with 
the demi-human soldiers

00:05:59.150 --> 00:06:00.870
to smoke out the intruders.

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:02.680
We should receive a report soon.

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:13.280
Monitoring and numerical records...

00:06:13.610 --> 00:06:16.480
What is the point in doing all this?

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:20.440
What His Majesty desired 
is already complete...

00:06:21.320 --> 00:06:26.400
But only Emperor Gaz knows 
how to activate it.

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:29.320
We haven't the slightest clue...

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:32.120
I will die soon.

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:35.120
Now that the emperor is dead,

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.850
is there any meaning in 
this island's existence?

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:40.750
Enter.

00:06:42.800 --> 00:06:44.800
The search party has returned.

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:49.160
They've captured the intruders 
and placed them in the dungeon.

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:53.050
We believe they were on board the 
cargo ship that passed by earlier.

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:55.190
Do you wish to interrogate them immediately?

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:56.410
It can wait.

00:06:57.290 --> 00:07:01.130
There are also signs of infiltration 
on the southern cliff wall.

00:07:01.130 --> 00:07:03.980
We searched the area, 
but found no one suspicious,

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:06.660
so we called off the search for now.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.140
You called it off?

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:11.410
I ordered you to capture all 
intruders on the island!

00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:13.250
I'm sorry...

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:16.730
But according to the reports, 
it was dark and footing was poor,

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:18.770
so pursuing them further would 
have endangered the men...

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:20.960
Don't you talk back to me!

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:23.000
When you demi-humans,

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:27.010
relics of the war, had nowhere 
left to go, I gave you work.

00:07:27.010 --> 00:07:30.090
All you need to do is follow my orders!

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:34.260
Yes, sir. Forgive me.

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:37.260
Lowly demi-human...

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:40.240
We have enough of the 
mass-produced models now.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:43.940
Maybe we should start using the demi-humans 
in experiments to get rid of them.

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:54.370
Here's your food.

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:56.000
Grateful.

00:07:57.270 --> 00:07:59.230
Why imprison me?

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:01.760
Why keep island secret?

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:04.500
I can't tell you anything.

00:08:04.970 --> 00:08:06.710
Someone higher up will come soon.

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:08.730
You should ask them.

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:09.740
Understood.

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:13.290
Ursula! Haven't you fed the 
Fayla yet? Get moving!

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:14.490
Y-Yes, sir!

00:08:14.490 --> 00:08:15.180
Ursula!

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:18.300
Ursula, chaste flower.

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:20.870
Yes, in Raackean...

00:08:21.820 --> 00:08:23.140
You speak Raackean?

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:25.880
Yes. Born in Gaz Empire.

00:08:25.880 --> 00:08:26.710
You, too?

00:08:26.710 --> 00:08:27.570
Yes.

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:28.190
I see...

00:08:28.580 --> 00:08:31.690
This island, research... 
Emperor Gaz's order?

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:36.370
I'm sorry. I don't know the details, either.

00:09:04.680 --> 00:09:07.610
They excavated the entire 
island to make this?

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:09.320
Pretty massive undertaking...

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:24.150
Fayla again?

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:35.880
What?

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:37.630
You're here, Akari?

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:40.180
Fredrica... Where's Chaika?

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:42.850
I'm looking for her, too.

00:09:43.230 --> 00:09:44.390
I see...

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.810
Just what is going on with this island?

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:56.030
To—

00:09:57.210 --> 00:09:59.280
You alone? Where's Fredrica?

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.140
Separated.

00:10:01.140 --> 00:10:01.990
Okay.

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:04.130
For now, we're getting out of here.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:06.750
Keep an eye out to make 
sure no one's coming.

00:10:08.010 --> 00:10:09.460
Toru... apology.

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:14.090
Was selfish.

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:15.550
Trouble for everyone.

00:10:15.830 --> 00:10:17.060
Oh...

00:10:17.060 --> 00:10:19.890
Nah, I might have been 
jumping the gun myself.

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:22.210
But we've found the island now.

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:24.720
Anyway, we'll talk later.

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:26.980
There's definitely something 
strange about this island.

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:28.520
Where's your coffin and Gundo?

00:10:28.900 --> 00:10:30.850
Coffin, with Fredrica.

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:31.980
Gundo confiscated.

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:33.880
The Gundo will have to wait.

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:36.370
We need to get somewhere safe first,

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:37.790
then we'll think about what comes next.

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:39.360
Yes.

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:48.420
Dragoons and Orthros?

00:10:48.420 --> 00:10:49.290
Yes.

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:51.980
And it was a Kraken that 
attacked the ship...

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:55.070
Are the people on this island taming Fayla?

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:01.000
Can't go this way.

00:11:01.400 --> 00:11:02.970
Let's look for another exit.

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:03.720
Yes.

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:18.650
What is this place?

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:30.910
If we dive in, it'll probably 
take us to the ocean outside,

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:33.330
but there's no way to guess how deep it is.

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:41.090
Fayla...

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:45.260
They are not true Fayla.

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:46.500
Who's there?!

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:52.020
They are all duplicates, outsider.

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:11.980
A Kraken...

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:22.040
Is this the one that just talked?

00:12:22.550 --> 00:12:23.960
Krakens can talk?

00:12:24.420 --> 00:12:27.710
Kraken, high intelligence. Dragoon, same.

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:29.970
What do you mean by duplicates?

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:34.200
This facility has been used to research the

00:12:34.200 --> 00:12:37.220
mass production of Fayla through 
application of forging magic.

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:41.370
Those discarded here are the failures.

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:43.690
Are you one of them, too?

00:12:44.210 --> 00:12:47.120
I was captured for experimentation.

00:12:47.710 --> 00:12:51.500
By studying and reproducing my flesh,

00:12:52.110 --> 00:12:54.920
they have mass-produced Krakens.

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:59.500
Cruel treatment...

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:03.060
Silver hair and purple eyes...

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:05.970
The Coffin Princess, Chaika.

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:08.300
You know Chaika?

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:12.160
I met a girl who called herself 
Chaika once, long ago.

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:16.880
After learning her own fate, 
she abandoned the name.

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:21.530
One day, I learned the truth...

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:26.160
We are all merely tools 
to gather his remains...

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:28.450
The Chaikas, as well as those who help us.

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:30.250
Layla...

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:32.480
She was on this island?

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:34.430
Want to know truth!

00:13:34.430 --> 00:13:35.960
Know truth about Chaika?

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:39.790
My life is nearing its end.

00:13:39.790 --> 00:13:44.730
If you have questions, I shall 
answer, Coffin Princess.

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:48.540
Who am I? Who is Chaika?

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:51.020
The one who will set destiny in motion.

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:54.170
You carry a coffin and gather the remains,

00:13:54.170 --> 00:13:55.980
and your body has become 
a tool for that purpose.

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:58.770
You hold the key to unlock destiny.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:01.100
Destiny?

00:14:01.890 --> 00:14:05.240
I came to bring her food, 
and the door was open...

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:07.700
She had a friend?

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.150
It's probably the one that the 
search party lost track of.

00:14:10.150 --> 00:14:12.820
I'm sorry, Cyril. I made a mistake...

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:14.200
It's not your fault.

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:17.270
But I know we'll be punished.

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:20.580
Izhmash-sama hates us demi-humans.

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:21.810
We might be killed...

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:22.960
I won't let him do that!

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:25.170
I'll capture them right away.

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:31.900
What's up? Sure is noisy out there.

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:33.520
Looks like something happened.

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:36.490
This might just be our chance...

00:14:37.830 --> 00:14:39.560
Hey, are you all right?

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:47.420
That which humans call "magic" is 
the power to materialize thoughts.

00:14:47.420 --> 00:14:50.440
Long ago, we Fayla

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:54.990
lived alongside this power before 
mankind even came to exist.

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:59.960
Soon enough, humans appeared, 
and they desired magic.

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:03.320
They imitated us, studied us,

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:06.460
and finally began to use 
man-made implements of magic,

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:09.720
allowing them to control 
many types of magic.

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:12.830
Magic implements... Gundo?

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:15.610
Eventually, with the arrival 
of one particular wizard,

00:15:15.610 --> 00:15:19.730
mankind's magic techniques 
experienced rapid development.

00:15:20.050 --> 00:15:22.900
He was the man called the Taboo Emperor:

00:15:23.220 --> 00:15:25.110
Arthur Gaz.

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:28.560
Father...

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:34.200
The Chaikas are tools to fulfill 
Emperor Gaz's grand ambitions.

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:38.690
Their life and death, their joy and sorrow,

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:41.300
are part of the gears that comprise them

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:43.260
and cannot be denied.

00:15:43.260 --> 00:15:44.960
How do you know this?

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:49.980
By sharing thoughts among many 
bodies since ancient times,

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:51.840
we have seen all.

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:54.160
When destiny is set in motion,

00:15:54.160 --> 00:15:58.340
not only humans, but we Fayla 
and all other living things

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:01.600
will be hurled into a maelstrom 
of destruction and slaughter.

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:05.380
The Chaikas hold the key to that future.

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:07.720
You must never forget this.

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:13.540
Damn it!

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:17.030
Chaika! Stay close to me!

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:17.490
Right!

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:25.790
You won't escape!

00:16:38.580 --> 00:16:39.180
Toru!

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:41.950
Damn it.

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:46.490
Chaika, are you okay?

00:16:46.490 --> 00:16:47.110
Yes.

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:48.220
Wait.

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:50.530
You just called her Chaika.

00:16:51.640 --> 00:16:52.990
Are you Chaika?

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:55.740
Did you say Chaika?

00:16:56.010 --> 00:16:58.380
Yes. I looked into it,

00:16:58.380 --> 00:17:02.120
and the girl in the group of intruders 
we captured looks just like her.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:04.170
She calls herself Chaika, as well.

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:07.010
Two Chaikas here at the same time...

00:17:07.630 --> 00:17:09.090
A coincidence?

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.450
No... This is interesting.

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:14.550
Bring them here. Both of them!

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.030
Castles?

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:21.500
That's right! Huge castles 
floating in the sky!

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:25.730
From the top of the hill close to here, 
you can see the national border.

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:28.010
So you saw castles in the sky over the border

00:17:28.010 --> 00:17:29.790
between this nation and the Gaz Empire?

00:17:29.790 --> 00:17:30.690
Yep!

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:35.790
There were five or six castles, 
huge ones like this,

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:37.930
floating there in the moonlight.

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:39.660
My back gave out then and there!

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:41.840
Five or six?

00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:45.490
But then, in the morning, 
they had vanished like smoke!

00:17:45.490 --> 00:17:46.920
When did this happen?

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:49.410
I was still just a boy.

00:17:49.410 --> 00:17:52.910
Eighty... No, ninety years ago?

00:17:52.910 --> 00:17:53.710
What?

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:56.930
Can you draw what they looked like on this?

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:02.350
They do look like floating fortresses.

00:18:02.350 --> 00:18:04.560
The Gaz Empire had floating fortresses?

00:18:05.470 --> 00:18:09.880
We detoured here hoping to find rumors of 
the emperor's fortune near the border,

00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:12.020
but we weren't expecting a story like this.

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:17.250
But floating fortresses hadn't 
been invented yet at that time.

00:18:17.250 --> 00:18:19.970
It doesn't seem to have anything 
to do with the fortune.

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:23.290
There's not much we can say, 
but we might as well report this.

00:18:23.520 --> 00:18:27.290
A fortune, floating fortresses, and Chaika...

00:18:28.230 --> 00:18:31.160
Just what was Emperor Gaz trying 
to leave behind in this world?

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:33.500
Izhmash-sama.

00:18:34.010 --> 00:18:35.350
I've brought them.

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:49.310
No touch!

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:51.480
Rude!

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:53.230
We meet again.

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:02.260
I see!

00:19:02.260 --> 00:19:05.100
Seeing you side by side, you do look alike.

00:19:05.100 --> 00:19:07.100
I welcome you, Chaika Gaz.

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:12.250
I am the assistant director of the Gaz 
Empire Institute of Magic, Viktor Izhmash.

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:15.020
Institute of Magic?

00:19:15.430 --> 00:19:16.510
Chaika...

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:18.600
She reacted?!

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:22.370
Could it be... No, that's right.

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:26.160
Last time a Chaika came here, 
she was still being developed.

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:28.230
So Chaika really is...

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:29.240
Last time?

00:19:29.240 --> 00:19:30.360
Layla?

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:34.020
This is magnificent! 
A result beyond my expectations!

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:38.880
Perhaps your coming here was all 
part of Emperor Gaz's plan!

00:19:39.310 --> 00:19:41.380
You, Father's servant!

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:43.320
I am emperor's daughter!

00:19:43.570 --> 00:19:45.520
Capture, imprison, rude!

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:52.720
His daughter? No, not quite.

00:19:53.430 --> 00:19:54.250
Listen to me.

00:19:54.720 --> 00:19:57.760
Emperor Gaz did not have a daughter.

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:00.820
L-Lie!

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:05.510
After the war, orphaned children 
were left all over the streets.

00:20:07.190 --> 00:20:08.980
According to the plans,

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:12.710
girls of the same age were 
gathered from among them,

00:20:12.710 --> 00:20:15.700
and magic was used to alter their memories.

00:20:20.380 --> 00:20:26.820
All of the girls received identical 
memories of being Emperor Gaz's daughter.

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:30.830
That's who the Chaikas are.

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:35.780
When the Chaikas awoke, they took up coffins

00:20:35.780 --> 00:20:38.130
and set out to collect 
the emperor's remains.

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:43.260
Though, it seems each was equipped with 
a different reason for collecting them.

00:20:44.880 --> 00:20:47.890
That's it! The proof is right there!

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:50.560
No! No, no!

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:57.270
The Chaikas are tools to fulfill 
Emperor Gaz's grand ambitions.

00:20:58.200 --> 00:21:02.290
Their life and death, their joy and sorrow,

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:04.880
are part of the gears that comprise them

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:06.920
and cannot be denied.

00:21:06.920 --> 00:21:08.920
You still don't know why you are alive,

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:11.450
why you were born.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:13.770
When you find out,

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:19.040
you'll be able to feel despair 
from the depths of your heart.

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:21.550
Chaika!

00:21:22.470 --> 00:21:26.760
Created memories... all fake...

00:21:27.130 --> 00:21:29.400
I am truly glad you came here!

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:31.720
Now my research can make vast progress!

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:36.400
I'm going to remove part of each 
of your brains and analyze them.

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:39.820
Bastard! Don't even—

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:42.200
What? There's no need to worry.

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:45.490
You will die here, but the 
remains will come together.

00:21:45.970 --> 00:21:48.620
The other Chaikas will collect them.

00:23:25.850 --> 00:23:28.050
Found Father's lab!

00:23:28.050 --> 00:23:30.350
Boss Izhmash, freak! Lunatic!

00:23:30.350 --> 00:23:32.970
Red Chaika and me, human experiments?!

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:34.930
And other girl captured!

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:37.180
Must rescue!

00:23:36.470 --> 00:23:39.980
The Emperor's Fortune

00:23:37.740 --> 00:23:39.980
Next time: "The Emperor's Fortune."
